# The exact dp-web4/web4 commit hestia releases build against.
# hestia/core has PATH deps into ../../web4 (web4-core, hub-plugin, web4-trust-core,
# web4-policy). They also carry crates.io versions so the crate can be published, but
# a source build uses the path, so without this pin a release is not reproducible:
# rebuilding the same tag against a moved web4 main yields a different binary.
# release.yml checks out THIS rev (not web4 main). Bump it deliberately when
# integrating a new web4 — that bump is the record of the integration.
d4b4adbe0d79832298b17fc97804ab9347d011f2
